```java
class Animal {
    protected String name;
    Animal(String name) { this.name = name; }
    void eat()  { System.out.println(name + " eats"); } // shared
    String sound() { return "..."; }
}

class Dog extends Animal {          // Dog IS-A Animal
    Dog(String name) { super(name); }   // call parent constructor
    @Override String sound() { return "Woof"; } // override
    void fetch() { System.out.println(name + " fetches"); } // add new
}

Dog d = new Dog("Rex");
d.eat();              // inherited from Animal
System.out.println(d.sound()); // Woof (overridden)
Animal a = d;         // polymorphism: treat Dog as Animal
```

